  "blocks": [
    {
      "text": "This article provides a summary of all new features and enhancements for Zscaler Cellular."
    },
    {
      "heading": "August 12, 2026",
      "level": 4
    },
    {
      "heading": "Feature Available",
      "level": 5
    },
    {
      "heading": "Location History",
      "level": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "A widget shows your SIM's movements across different locations and the network events triggered by those transitions. To learn more, see Viewing SIM Details."
    },
    {
      "text": "See image."
    },
    {
      "heading": "June 05, 2026",
      "level": 4
    },
    {
      "heading": "Feature Available",
      "level": 5
    },
    {
      "heading": "Audit Logs",
      "level": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Added support for Audit Logs, which enables administrators to track configuration changes, view administrative actions, identify who performed each action, and review when changes occurred through a searchable and filterable audit log."
    },
    {
      "text": "See image."
    },
    {
      "text": "To learn more, see About Zscaler Cellular Audit Logs."
    },
    {
      "heading": "June 01, 2026",
      "level": 4
    },
    {
      "heading": "Feature Available",
      "level": 5
    },
    {
      "heading": "Zscaler Cellular API",
      "level": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Zscaler Cellular supports the use of APIs that give you programmatic access to various Zscaler Cellular features and functionalities. The Zscaler Cellular API is accessible via OneAPI. The following API endpoints have been introduced to support Zscaler Cellular configurations:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Anomaly Policies",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "GET /api/v1/customers/{id}/anomaly-policy",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "POST /api/v1/customers/{id}/anomaly-policy",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "DELETE /api/v1/customers/{id}/anomaly-policy/{policyId}",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "PATCH /api/v1/customers/{id}/anomaly-policy/{policyId}",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "GET /api/v1/customers/{id}/anomaly-policy/{policyId}/logs",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "PATCH /api/v1/customers/{id}/anomaly-policy/{policyId}/status",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "GET /api/v1/customers/{id}/anomaly-policy/{policyId}/violations",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "GET /api/v1/customers/{id}/anomaly-policy/{policyId}/violations/{iccid}",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Audit Logs",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "POST /api/v1/audit/customers/{id}/search",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Customer Management",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "GET /api/v1/customers/{id}",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "PUT /api/v1/customers/{id}",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Customer Regions",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "GET /api/v1/customers/{id}/regions",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "PUT /api/v1/customers/{id}/regions",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "GET /api/v1/customers/{id}/regions/operational-status",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Network Events",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "POST /api/v1/network-events/{id}/search/startTime/{startTime}/endTime/{endTime}",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "SIM Analytics",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "POST /api/v1/customers/{id}/sim/analytics/map",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "GET /api/v1/customers/{id}/sim/analytics/summary",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "GET /api/v1/customers/{id}/sim/analytics/usage/countries",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "GET /api/v1/customers/{id}/sim/analytics/usage/day",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "GET /api/v1/customers/{id}/sim/analytics/usage/sims",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "SIM Location Groups",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "GET /api/v1/customers/{id}/sim-location-groups",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "POST /api/v1/customers/{id}/sim-location-groups",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "GET /api/v1/customers/{id}/sim-location-groups/{simLocationGroupId}",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "PUT /api/v1/customers/{id}/sim-location-groups/{simLocationGroupId}",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "DELETE /api/v1/customers/{id}/sim-location-groups/{simLocationGroupId}",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "SIM Management",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "PATCH /api/v1/customers/{id}/sims/assign/tag",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "GET /api/v1/customers/{id}/sims/details",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "POST /api/v1/customers/{id}/sims/download",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "PATCH /api/v1/customers/{id}/sims/lock",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "POST /api/v1/customers/{id}/sims/search",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "PATCH /api/v1/customers/{id}/sims/status",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "PATCH /api/v1/customers/{id}/sims/{iccid}/assign",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "PATCH /api/v1/customers/{id}/sims/{iccid}/state",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "GET /api/v1/customers/{id}/sims/{iccid}/tower-locations",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Tag Management",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "GET /api/v1/customers/{id}/tag",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "POST /api/v1/customers/{id}/tag",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "To learn more about each endpoint, see the API Reference."
    },
    {
      "text": "All endpoints are subject to a rate limit of 1,000 calls per minute, per tenant. To learn more, see Cellular API Rate Limits and Cellular API Codes."
    },
    {
      "text": "The OneAPI Postman Collection is also updated to include new resources. To learn more, see Configuring the Postman REST API Client."
    }
  ]
}
